1
00:00:16,534 --> 00:00:22,869
(Firefly Theater)

2
00:00:43,456 --> 00:00:47,392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

3
00:00:49,024 --> 00:00:52,608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

4
00:00:53,184 --> 00:00:55,520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

5
00:00:55,904 --> 00:00:58,656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

6
00:00:59,488 --> 00:01:02,080
♪I've seen this game before♪

7
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:04,768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

8
00:01:04,768 --> 00:01:07,168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

9
00:01:07,552 --> 00:01:10,304
♪Just an empty shell♪

10
00:01:10,624 --> 00:01:13,440
♪I've broken this game before♪

11
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:15,872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

12
00:01:15,872 --> 00:01:18,016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

13
00:01:18,208 --> 00:01:25,056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

14
00:01:25,728 --> 00:01:28,256
♪When I stand back up again♪

15
00:01:28,544 --> 00:01:30,400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

16
00:01:31,264 --> 00:01:33,952
♪For the part you owe me♪

17
00:01:34,112 --> 00:01:41,088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

18
00:01:42,624 --> 00:01:47,360
♪You're just my starting point♪

19
00:01:51,712 --> 00:01:52,739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

20
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,720
=Episode 7=

21
00:01:56,721 --> 00:01:57,321
Wait,

22
00:01:58,601 --> 00:01:59,562
I asked my mom about it.

23
00:01:59,601 --> 00:02:00,801
She said Liren even wanted

24
00:02:00,922 --> 00:02:02,282
to interview Lu Hui one-on-one.

25
00:02:03,002 --> 00:02:04,161
They went into the study,

26
00:02:04,521 --> 00:02:05,961
and after the interview,

27
00:02:06,161 --> 00:02:07,321
he reluctantly hired Lu Hui.

28
00:02:07,562 --> 00:02:08,842
So Liren didn't know this

29
00:02:08,921 --> 00:02:09,881
in advance.

30
00:02:10,242 --> 00:02:11,201
And both of them tacitly

31
00:02:11,282 --> 00:02:12,842
pretended not to know each other.

32
00:02:13,282 --> 00:02:14,601
Di Liren wanted to

33
00:02:14,641 --> 00:02:15,601
hide his past marriage.

34
00:02:16,962 --> 00:02:17,881
Then why

35
00:02:18,321 --> 00:02:19,481
did he let her stay?

36
00:02:19,921 --> 00:02:20,761
Maybe

37
00:02:21,082 --> 00:02:22,082
Lu Hui used it

38
00:02:22,082 --> 00:02:22,761
to blackmail him.

39
00:02:24,362 --> 00:02:25,201
What does she want?

40
00:02:26,041 --> 00:02:26,842
I'm not sure yet.

41
00:02:27,761 --> 00:02:28,201
Right.

42
00:02:28,641 --> 00:02:29,041
Today...

43
00:02:29,041 --> 00:02:29,481
Meng.

44
00:02:33,041 --> 00:02:33,562
Meng.

45
00:02:37,041 --> 00:02:37,641
Meng.

46
00:02:42,402 --> 00:02:44,441
This is the new caregiver, Duan.

47
00:02:44,881 --> 00:02:46,122
She's been working here

48
00:02:46,441 --> 00:02:47,242
and is experienced.

49
00:02:47,481 --> 00:02:47,761
Hello.

50
00:02:47,842 --> 00:02:49,161
The head nurse recommended me.

51
00:02:49,161 --> 00:02:50,641
I just got off my shift on 3rd floor.

52
00:02:50,682 --> 00:02:51,481
I can start working

53
00:02:51,522 --> 00:02:52,201
right away.

54
00:02:53,201 --> 00:02:53,562
Hello.

55
00:02:54,161 --> 00:02:54,752
Out to talk?

56
00:02:54,802 --> 00:02:55,041
Okay.

57
00:02:55,481 --> 00:02:56,082
Let's go, Duan.

58
00:02:59,601 --> 00:03:00,562
Ms. Hui,

59
00:03:01,041 --> 00:03:02,842
did my parents meet Duan already?

60
00:03:03,161 --> 00:03:04,201
Yes, just now.

61
00:03:04,721 --> 00:03:06,002
She is very experienced.

62
00:03:06,041 --> 00:03:06,761
She can

63
00:03:06,802 --> 00:03:07,962
crank the bed silently.

64
00:03:08,282 --> 00:03:09,362
She even memorized

65
00:03:09,441 --> 00:03:10,242
all those drug names

66
00:03:10,362 --> 00:03:11,242
with their effects.

67
00:03:11,962 --> 00:03:12,802
That's great.

68
00:03:13,802 --> 00:03:14,161
Meng,

69
00:03:14,522 --> 00:03:15,321
you can go back.

70
00:03:16,082 --> 00:03:16,962
Let me instruct her.

71
00:03:17,802 --> 00:03:18,161
Duan,

72
00:03:18,362 --> 00:03:19,122
while I'm here,

73
00:03:19,441 --> 00:03:20,641
ask me anything you need.

74
00:03:21,242 --> 00:03:22,242
I'll walk you through it.

75
00:03:23,522 --> 00:03:24,481
Make sure

76
00:03:24,761 --> 00:03:26,601
to finish his assisted exercises

77
00:03:26,842 --> 00:03:28,242
every morning before breakfast.

78
00:03:28,481 --> 00:03:28,881
Got it?

79
00:03:29,161 --> 00:03:30,201
And inside that room...

80
00:03:32,402 --> 00:03:33,601
(The new caregiver is here.)

81
00:03:33,761 --> 00:03:35,402
(Lu Hui is leaving.)

82
00:03:36,962 --> 00:03:37,921
(She saved your dad)

83
00:03:38,082 --> 00:03:39,682
(and earned your family's gratitude.)

84
00:03:40,802 --> 00:03:42,161
(Logically, she shouldn't leave.)

85
00:03:42,362 --> 00:03:43,282
(To transfer assets,)

86
00:03:43,282 --> 00:03:44,682
(Di Liren needs someone he trusts.)

87
00:03:45,201 --> 00:03:45,881
(Given)

88
00:03:45,881 --> 00:03:46,881
(her thing with him,)

89
00:03:47,201 --> 00:03:47,682
(right now,)

90
00:03:48,321 --> 00:03:49,881
(she's my prime suspect.)

91
00:03:50,641 --> 00:03:51,481
(If she leaves,)

92
00:03:51,962 --> 00:03:53,082
(we'll lose this lead.)

93
00:03:53,921 --> 00:03:55,041
(Find a way to keep her.)

94
00:04:23,122 --> 00:04:23,722
I can't do it.

95
00:04:24,482 --> 00:04:25,922
If I fall from here,

96
00:04:26,362 --> 00:04:27,881
I'll be maimed or worse.

97
00:04:39,521 --> 00:04:40,122
A little lower.

98
00:04:47,042 --> 00:04:47,482
Whatever.

99
00:04:48,961 --> 00:04:49,841
No pain,

100
00:04:50,362 --> 00:04:51,162
no gain.

101
00:04:52,002 --> 00:04:52,521
I'm doing it.

102
00:04:58,482 --> 00:04:58,922
Easy.

103
00:05:02,362 --> 00:05:03,401
Watch your head!

104
00:05:08,761 --> 00:05:09,321
Slow down.

105
00:05:09,321 --> 00:05:10,362
My foot!

106
00:05:19,122 --> 00:05:20,002
Meng wants me

107
00:05:20,002 --> 00:05:21,201
to look after her for a while.

108
00:05:21,682 --> 00:05:22,562
I'll leave

109
00:05:22,602 --> 00:05:23,341
once she's better.

110
00:05:25,321 --> 00:05:26,802
Didn't you already resign?

111
00:05:27,201 --> 00:05:27,922
Why stay?

112
00:05:28,081 --> 00:05:29,042
You're busy with work,

113
00:05:29,761 --> 00:05:31,242
and she might hold you back.

114
00:05:32,042 --> 00:05:32,922
You'll get busier.

115
00:05:33,042 --> 00:05:34,042
If I don't watch you,

116
00:05:34,961 --> 00:05:36,562
you'll break your word.

117
00:05:38,482 --> 00:05:39,242
What if she

118
00:05:39,242 --> 00:05:40,562
posts your video online?

119
00:05:40,841 --> 00:05:41,562
Aren't you afraid?

120
00:05:41,722 --> 00:05:42,961
You can handle it.

121
00:05:43,841 --> 00:05:44,922
You won't let her post it.

122
00:05:45,281 --> 00:05:46,122
I can't promise that.

123
00:05:46,802 --> 00:05:47,802
I can hire a caregiver

124
00:05:48,201 --> 00:05:49,162
to replace you.

125
00:05:49,201 --> 00:05:50,081
Did you forget?

126
00:05:50,521 --> 00:05:51,562
Your wife hates strangers

127
00:05:51,562 --> 00:05:52,441
in the house.

128
00:05:52,562 --> 00:05:53,641
I'm the only option.

129
00:05:55,122 --> 00:05:56,401
I'll hand things over to Duan

130
00:05:56,761 --> 00:05:57,722
and move in later.

131
00:06:10,321 --> 00:06:11,042
(Do me a favor.)

132
00:06:23,722 --> 00:06:24,162
Who's this?

133
00:06:24,761 --> 00:06:25,321
Hello, Mr. Di.

134
00:06:25,602 --> 00:06:26,281
This is Jiao Xu.

135
00:06:26,802 --> 00:06:27,881
You came to see me before.

136
00:06:29,602 --> 00:06:30,162
Sure,

137
00:06:30,162 --> 00:06:31,002
what's up?

138
00:06:31,401 --> 00:06:32,081
Well,

139
00:06:32,961 --> 00:06:33,881
I've been thinking

140
00:06:33,881 --> 00:06:34,802
the case you mentioned

141
00:06:34,961 --> 00:06:36,081
about your friend.

142
00:06:37,081 --> 00:06:38,201
It sounds quite interesting.

143
00:06:38,722 --> 00:06:40,242
And a client of mine just decided

144
00:06:40,242 --> 00:06:41,281
not to divorce.

145
00:06:41,482 --> 00:06:42,722
So now my schedule is open.

146
00:06:43,242 --> 00:06:43,841
What a pity.

147
00:06:44,562 --> 00:06:45,401
You've missed it.

148
00:06:45,961 --> 00:06:46,881
My friend

149
00:06:47,321 --> 00:06:48,602
has retained another lawyer.

150
00:07:01,321 --> 00:07:02,242
It's ironic, huh?

151
00:07:03,162 --> 00:07:04,881
I've been trying to hunt for mistresses,

152
00:07:05,641 --> 00:07:06,602
only to find out

153
00:07:07,002 --> 00:07:08,081
I'm the mistress.

154
00:07:08,722 --> 00:07:09,482
Another mistress...

155
00:07:11,002 --> 00:07:11,482
Careful.

156
00:07:12,042 --> 00:07:13,401
She is actually his first wife!

157
00:07:13,761 --> 00:07:15,201
Who knew they hid it that well?

158
00:07:15,881 --> 00:07:16,841
Don't blame yourself.

159
00:07:18,081 --> 00:07:19,281
But what are you thinking?

160
00:07:19,562 --> 00:07:21,002
Why did you let Lu Hui move in?

161
00:07:22,602 --> 00:07:24,122
If she moves in,

162
00:07:24,321 --> 00:07:25,122
I can

163
00:07:25,122 --> 00:07:26,281
observe them up close.

164
00:07:27,841 --> 00:07:28,922
I want to see

165
00:07:29,281 --> 00:07:30,641
how they interact,

166
00:07:30,841 --> 00:07:31,847
if they trust each other,

167
00:07:32,321 --> 00:07:33,081
and whether they

168
00:07:33,242 --> 00:07:34,641
team up out of self-interest

169
00:07:34,761 --> 00:07:35,761
or out of affection

170
00:07:35,761 --> 00:07:36,521
as exes.

171
00:07:36,722 --> 00:07:37,761
I want to know it all.

172
00:07:37,881 --> 00:07:39,562
Who would want to work

173
00:07:39,562 --> 00:07:40,521
in an ex's house?

174
00:07:40,761 --> 00:07:41,841
Seeing you and Liren

175
00:07:41,881 --> 00:07:42,362
together,

176
00:07:42,562 --> 00:07:43,482
wouldn't that hurt her?

177
00:07:44,002 --> 00:07:45,362
That's not my problem.

178
00:07:47,922 --> 00:07:49,281
Think about it, Zi.

179
00:07:50,602 --> 00:07:51,881
If Lu Hui really

180
00:07:52,042 --> 00:07:53,002
still has feelings

181
00:07:53,042 --> 00:07:53,922
for Liren,

182
00:07:54,602 --> 00:07:55,441
wouldn't that give me

183
00:07:55,482 --> 00:07:56,242
a great opening?

184
00:07:56,401 --> 00:07:57,401
I can drive them apart

185
00:07:57,521 --> 00:07:58,441
and get something

186
00:07:58,482 --> 00:07:59,401
on Liren.

187
00:07:59,521 --> 00:08:00,641
If she still has feelings

188
00:08:00,722 --> 00:08:01,441
for him,

189
00:08:01,494 --> 00:08:02,401
isn't it risky for you

190
00:08:02,401 --> 00:08:03,401
to live together?

191
00:08:05,562 --> 00:08:07,321
Why not install hidden cameras at home?

192
00:08:10,002 --> 00:08:11,362
I thought about it,

193
00:08:12,042 --> 00:08:12,761
but...

194
00:08:14,002 --> 00:08:14,802
Both of them are

195
00:08:14,802 --> 00:08:15,841
more vigilant than I am.

196
00:08:16,242 --> 00:08:17,321
It might backfire on me.

197
00:08:18,042 --> 00:08:18,682
Besides,

198
00:08:18,802 --> 00:08:19,802
it's my house.

199
00:08:20,042 --> 00:08:21,122
What can they do to me?

200
00:08:21,722 --> 00:08:22,761
That would expose them.

201
00:08:29,081 --> 00:08:29,722
Mr. Jiao.

202
00:08:33,921 --> 00:08:34,482
Mr. Jiao.

203
00:08:35,002 --> 00:08:36,521
I asked you to keep her,

204
00:08:37,362 --> 00:08:38,842
not to hurt yourself.

205
00:08:40,761 --> 00:08:42,842
Well, no pain, no gain.

206
00:08:44,161 --> 00:08:45,242
I was defensive before.

207
00:08:45,561 --> 00:08:46,921
Now, I'm playing offense.

208
00:08:47,722 --> 00:08:48,801
You even had me call Liren

209
00:08:48,801 --> 00:08:49,521
deliberately,

210
00:08:49,722 --> 00:08:50,999
pretending you dropped the case

211
00:08:51,082 --> 00:08:52,681
to lower his guard.

212
00:08:54,602 --> 00:08:55,202
Spill it.

213
00:08:55,530 --> 00:08:56,242
What's your plan?

214
00:08:59,401 --> 00:09:00,602
I'm going back to the company.

215
00:09:01,128 --> 00:09:02,543
(May boss's wife stay young and pretty)

216
00:09:02,561 --> 00:09:03,921
My dad's in poor health right now.

217
00:09:04,641 --> 00:09:05,482
I don't dare tell him

218
00:09:05,521 --> 00:09:06,322
what Liren is doing.

219
00:09:07,722 --> 00:09:08,761
The priority now

220
00:09:08,921 --> 00:09:10,082
is to figure out

221
00:09:10,202 --> 00:09:11,641
how the company is really doing,

222
00:09:12,161 --> 00:09:13,082
find leverage on him,

223
00:09:13,442 --> 00:09:14,401
and protect my assets.

224
00:09:15,002 --> 00:09:15,801
(May boss's wife stay young and pretty)
Before,

225
00:09:16,281 --> 00:09:17,722
I was too naive.

226
00:09:18,561 --> 00:09:19,362
From now on,

227
00:09:20,161 --> 00:09:21,161
I'm not the boss's wife.

228
00:09:22,161 --> 00:09:23,082
I'm the boss.

229
00:09:43,842 --> 00:09:44,521
What's wrong?

230
00:09:45,202 --> 00:09:45,842
Can't sleep?

231
00:09:53,761 --> 00:09:54,362
Why slap me?

232
00:09:54,602 --> 00:09:55,681
You're so annoying!

233
00:09:56,921 --> 00:09:58,122
You pissed me off in my dream.

234
00:09:58,161 --> 00:09:59,322
I was furious!

235
00:10:01,641 --> 00:10:02,761
So it was just a nightmare.

236
00:10:06,401 --> 00:10:07,041
Tell me,

237
00:10:07,082 --> 00:10:08,122
how did I upset you?

238
00:10:08,401 --> 00:10:09,082
Get lost.

239
00:10:09,842 --> 00:10:10,921
I could kill you right now.

240
00:10:13,242 --> 00:10:14,041
Come on.

241
00:10:14,681 --> 00:10:16,082
You'll feel better once you say it.

242
00:10:16,442 --> 00:10:17,242
You took me

243
00:10:17,242 --> 00:10:18,281
to a dinner party.

244
00:10:19,442 --> 00:10:20,921
There were so many people there,

245
00:10:21,962 --> 00:10:22,881
but you didn't

246
00:10:22,921 --> 00:10:23,921
introduce me to them.

247
00:10:24,722 --> 00:10:25,761
Then you opened the door.

248
00:10:26,602 --> 00:10:27,322
Right after that,

249
00:10:27,722 --> 00:10:29,242
a bunch of gorgeous women walked in.

250
00:10:30,242 --> 00:10:31,401
Everyone crowded around them

251
00:10:31,921 --> 00:10:33,641
and called them all "Meng".

252
00:10:34,442 --> 00:10:37,362
Nobody paid attention to me.

253
00:10:38,281 --> 00:10:41,002
You had so many Mengs!

254
00:10:41,602 --> 00:10:42,561
Come on.

255
00:10:42,722 --> 00:10:43,602
That's ridiculous.

256
00:10:44,482 --> 00:10:45,641
Then I woke up terrified.

257
00:10:47,281 --> 00:10:48,681
And when I woke up,

258
00:10:49,041 --> 00:10:50,521
my chest felt so tight.

259
00:10:50,561 --> 00:10:51,161
It was awful.

260
00:10:52,041 --> 00:10:53,362
I could barely breathe.

261
00:10:54,242 --> 00:10:54,962
Only after

262
00:10:55,002 --> 00:10:56,202
I slapped you just now

263
00:10:57,122 --> 00:10:58,681
did I finally feel better.

264
00:11:01,362 --> 00:11:02,002
Honey,

265
00:11:02,521 --> 00:11:03,962
did I hit you too hard?

266
00:11:04,161 --> 00:11:05,122
Did it hurt?

267
00:11:05,921 --> 00:11:06,521
It's fine.

268
00:11:07,521 --> 00:11:08,442
It didn't hurt at all.

269
00:11:09,401 --> 00:11:10,602
As long as you're not mad.

270
00:11:12,082 --> 00:11:13,041
It's my fault.

271
00:11:13,314 --> 00:11:13,801
I shouldn't

272
00:11:13,801 --> 00:11:14,722
have taken you there.

273
00:11:16,881 --> 00:11:17,561
All right,

274
00:11:17,681 --> 00:11:18,362
don't be mad.

275
00:11:18,681 --> 00:11:19,281
Go to bed.

276
00:11:21,122 --> 00:11:21,442
Come on.

277
00:11:23,681 --> 00:11:24,322
Wait a second.

278
00:11:24,602 --> 00:11:25,122
Come on.

279
00:11:25,641 --> 00:11:26,401
Careful.

280
00:11:27,641 --> 00:11:28,561
Easy.

281
00:11:29,801 --> 00:11:30,362
Stand steady.

282
00:11:30,641 --> 00:11:31,401
Let me pull if off.

283
00:11:32,881 --> 00:11:33,962
Let me help you, honey.

284
00:11:37,881 --> 00:11:38,722
It's okay.

285
00:11:40,482 --> 00:11:42,401
Why can't I do anything right?

286
00:11:42,962 --> 00:11:44,242
I'm just holding you back.

287
00:11:45,482 --> 00:11:46,521
If this keeps up,

288
00:11:47,521 --> 00:11:49,002
someone will replace me eventually.

289
00:11:49,202 --> 00:11:50,002
There, there.

290
00:11:50,242 --> 00:11:50,962
Don't cry.

291
00:11:51,962 --> 00:11:52,722
It's no big deal.

292
00:11:52,842 --> 00:11:54,082
Anyone can knock things over.

293
00:11:54,281 --> 00:11:55,322
You're being sensitive.

294
00:11:56,602 --> 00:11:57,482
It's my fault.

295
00:11:57,962 --> 00:11:58,641
A dinner

296
00:11:58,722 --> 00:12:00,041
gave you so much pressure.

297
00:12:00,322 --> 00:12:01,002
Honey,

298
00:12:02,322 --> 00:12:03,122
I know why.

299
00:12:04,202 --> 00:12:05,561
I have too much free time.

300
00:12:06,161 --> 00:12:07,281
No wonder people say

301
00:12:07,561 --> 00:12:09,281
idle hands make trouble.

302
00:12:09,722 --> 00:12:10,761
How about this, honey?

303
00:12:11,561 --> 00:12:12,921
Find me something to do,

304
00:12:13,161 --> 00:12:14,242
so I can get back on track.

305
00:12:14,281 --> 00:12:14,761
Please.

306
00:12:15,002 --> 00:12:15,921
Then tell me.

307
00:12:16,122 --> 00:12:16,962
What do you want?

308
00:12:17,801 --> 00:12:18,322
Shopping?

309
00:12:20,641 --> 00:12:21,281
Traveling?

310
00:12:23,362 --> 00:12:25,002
Throwing parties?

311
00:12:27,681 --> 00:12:28,442
I don't know

312
00:12:28,442 --> 00:12:29,842
what I want to do either,

313
00:12:30,482 --> 00:12:32,082
but I just don't want to sit around.

314
00:12:32,561 --> 00:12:33,442
Honey,

315
00:12:33,602 --> 00:12:34,801
I'm really at the office.

316
00:12:34,881 --> 00:12:35,842
I'm not lying to you.

317
00:12:36,842 --> 00:12:37,801
Show me over there.

318
00:12:38,602 --> 00:12:39,041
Okay.

319
00:12:40,921 --> 00:12:41,602
See?

320
00:12:43,281 --> 00:12:44,242
Don't move so fast.

321
00:12:44,242 --> 00:12:45,202
I can't see clearly.

322
00:12:45,602 --> 00:12:46,401
Okay, I'll be slow.

323
00:12:46,521 --> 00:12:47,202
One more time.

324
00:12:50,002 --> 00:12:51,442
For our new product line,

325
00:12:51,921 --> 00:12:53,401
the quality...

326
00:12:54,344 --> 00:12:55,176
(My Dear Wife)

327
00:12:57,761 --> 00:12:58,442
The quality

328
00:12:58,801 --> 00:13:00,242
of our new product line

329
00:13:00,482 --> 00:13:01,281
must be guaranteed

330
00:13:01,442 --> 00:13:02,122
as always,

331
00:13:02,602 --> 00:13:03,281
and we also...

332
00:13:03,880 --> 00:13:06,744
(My Dear Wife)

333
00:13:10,401 --> 00:13:11,041
Excuse me.

334
00:13:12,962 --> 00:13:14,322
We must ensure quality

335
00:13:14,482 --> 00:13:16,281
and ramp up marketing

336
00:13:16,641 --> 00:13:18,082
to promote across all channels.

337
00:13:18,082 --> 00:13:18,681
(Mrs. Di)

338
00:13:18,681 --> 00:13:19,161
Meanwhile,

339
00:13:19,401 --> 00:13:19,921
- we...
- Mr. Di,

340
00:13:20,801 --> 00:13:21,681
Mrs. Di is calling.

341
00:13:34,602 --> 00:13:34,962
Hello?

342
00:13:36,161 --> 00:13:36,681
Honey,

343
00:13:36,681 --> 00:13:38,401
I'm really bored.

344
00:13:38,561 --> 00:13:39,273
Go find Liu Zi.

345
00:13:40,002 --> 00:13:41,041
She's swamped.

346
00:13:41,122 --> 00:13:42,233
She told me not to bug her.

347
00:13:44,442 --> 00:13:45,842
You said you wanted to keep busy.

348
00:13:46,962 --> 00:13:47,602
Any ideas?

349
00:13:49,442 --> 00:13:50,002
Sure.

350
00:13:54,561 --> 00:13:55,082
Honey,

351
00:13:55,401 --> 00:13:56,405
I'm going back to work.

352
00:14:17,962 --> 00:14:18,602
Honey,

353
00:14:19,681 --> 00:14:20,521
did you decide

354
00:14:20,561 --> 00:14:21,442
to get back to work

355
00:14:21,801 --> 00:14:23,122
just to buy all these desk toys?

356
00:14:23,761 --> 00:14:24,641
So what?

357
00:14:24,881 --> 00:14:27,082
Work should be fun too.

358
00:14:27,602 --> 00:14:28,761
Look at this wooden fish.

359
00:14:29,442 --> 00:14:30,122
Isn't it cute?

360
00:14:31,322 --> 00:14:32,921
Tap it, and get merit.

361
00:14:33,202 --> 00:14:35,002
Tap it again, and get merit again.

362
00:14:36,482 --> 00:14:37,482
How old are you?

363
00:14:37,801 --> 00:14:38,881
You're like a child.

364
00:14:40,442 --> 00:14:41,161
Let me guess.

365
00:14:41,722 --> 00:14:42,681
You already

366
00:14:42,722 --> 00:14:43,986
picked out your first-day suit?

367
00:14:44,161 --> 00:14:45,041
I almost forgot!

368
00:14:45,362 --> 00:14:45,842
Ms. Hui,

369
00:14:46,122 --> 00:14:47,161
could you iron my clothes?

370
00:14:47,681 --> 00:14:48,082
Sure.

371
00:15:05,242 --> 00:15:06,681
She suddenly wants to work.

372
00:15:07,442 --> 00:15:08,122
Why?

373
00:15:08,641 --> 00:15:09,521
Could it be

374
00:15:09,561 --> 00:15:10,362
that she is

375
00:15:11,281 --> 00:15:12,242
up to something?

376
00:15:14,641 --> 00:15:15,281
I don't know.

377
00:15:16,161 --> 00:15:16,881
But

378
00:15:17,122 --> 00:15:18,401
given all the stuff she bought,

379
00:15:19,641 --> 00:15:20,801
it's just like an impulse.

380
00:15:21,082 --> 00:15:22,722
Doesn't look like she's going to work.

381
00:15:23,242 --> 00:15:23,881
Maybe.

382
00:15:25,602 --> 00:15:26,722
I found this in her room.

383
00:15:27,521 --> 00:15:27,962
(Yihe Firm)
I checked.

384
00:15:28,362 --> 00:15:29,161
This law firm

385
00:15:29,161 --> 00:15:30,602
specializes in divorce litigation.

386
00:15:34,801 --> 00:15:35,561
It's handled.

387
00:15:36,082 --> 00:15:36,681
Are you sure?

388
00:15:37,681 --> 00:15:38,881
She'd never divorce me.

389
00:15:39,550 --> 00:15:41,057
She can't even handle the water bill.

390
00:15:41,482 --> 00:15:42,921
Without me, what can she do?

391
00:15:44,881 --> 00:15:46,362
Fine, as long as you took care of it.

392
00:15:47,362 --> 00:15:48,641
What do you wear for tomorrow?

393
00:15:48,921 --> 00:15:50,161
Let me iron your shirt.

394
00:15:50,482 --> 00:15:51,921
No need. I'll do it myself.

395
00:15:54,281 --> 00:15:55,641
You're both going to work,

396
00:15:56,401 --> 00:15:57,801
so what am I supposed to do here?

397
00:15:58,082 --> 00:15:59,122
I have to do something.

398
00:16:02,962 --> 00:16:04,002
Aren't you so independent,

399
00:16:04,602 --> 00:16:05,921
always figuring things out alone?

400
00:16:06,362 --> 00:16:07,041
Why ask me

401
00:16:07,322 --> 00:16:08,202
about it then?

402
00:16:20,362 --> 00:16:20,962
Honey,

403
00:16:21,561 --> 00:16:22,082
what made you

404
00:16:22,122 --> 00:16:23,041
clean this room?

405
00:16:23,761 --> 00:16:24,715
Someone staying over?

406
00:16:24,801 --> 00:16:25,401
It's me.

407
00:16:26,362 --> 00:16:27,122
Ms. Hui,

408
00:16:27,722 --> 00:16:29,322
give me a hand, please.

409
00:16:30,242 --> 00:16:32,002
The doctor said
my leg can't bear weight.

410
00:16:32,432 --> 00:16:33,761
You always roll onto me at night.

411
00:16:33,761 --> 00:16:35,122
I need to sleep alone to recover.

412
00:16:35,401 --> 00:16:35,801
Ms. Hui,

413
00:16:35,962 --> 00:16:36,801
change the sheets.

414
00:16:37,202 --> 00:16:37,602
Sure.

415
00:16:38,602 --> 00:16:39,041
Wait.

416
00:16:40,521 --> 00:16:41,041
Honey,

417
00:16:41,641 --> 00:16:42,641
we can switch sides.

418
00:16:42,921 --> 00:16:43,641
So at night,

419
00:16:43,722 --> 00:16:44,669
I won't roll onto you.

420
00:16:45,161 --> 00:16:46,281
I've told you so many times.

421
00:16:46,322 --> 00:16:47,521
I can't sleep on your side.

422
00:16:47,921 --> 00:16:48,848
Ms. Hui, ignore him.

423
00:16:48,921 --> 00:16:49,482
Do what I say.

424
00:16:49,671 --> 00:16:50,387
I call the shots.

425
00:16:53,242 --> 00:16:53,801
But

426
00:16:54,161 --> 00:16:55,242
this room was meant

427
00:16:55,561 --> 00:16:56,602
for Ms. Hui.

428
00:16:56,801 --> 00:16:57,482
Oh, right.

429
00:16:59,722 --> 00:17:01,202
Ms. Hui just moved in today,

430
00:17:01,362 --> 00:17:02,962
and this was supposed to be hers.

431
00:17:03,242 --> 00:17:04,642
But what can I do?

432
00:17:04,682 --> 00:17:06,081
I have to listen to the doctor.

433
00:17:07,242 --> 00:17:08,242
How about this, Ms. Hui?

434
00:17:09,041 --> 00:17:10,561
Could you make do

435
00:17:10,922 --> 00:17:12,402
with the nursery

436
00:17:12,402 --> 00:17:12,882
for a while?

437
00:17:13,922 --> 00:17:14,482
No problem.

438
00:17:14,962 --> 00:17:15,521
Thanks.

439
00:17:15,841 --> 00:17:17,002
See? She's fine with it.

440
00:17:18,121 --> 00:17:18,722
How about this?

441
00:17:19,242 --> 00:17:20,205
Master bedroom's yours.

442
00:17:20,321 --> 00:17:21,081
I'll sleep here.

443
00:17:21,561 --> 00:17:22,442
No.

444
00:17:23,281 --> 00:17:24,041
This room

445
00:17:24,402 --> 00:17:25,402
is closer to Ms. Hui's.

446
00:17:25,482 --> 00:17:27,002
I can call her if I need anything.

447
00:17:27,442 --> 00:17:28,801
You sleep like a log,

448
00:17:28,801 --> 00:17:29,631
dead to the world.

449
00:17:29,761 --> 00:17:30,521
You can't help.

450
00:17:32,202 --> 00:17:32,642
Ms. Hui,

451
00:17:33,162 --> 00:17:33,682
do your work.

452
00:17:53,144 --> 00:17:56,763
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

453
00:17:58,648 --> 00:18:02,330
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

454
00:18:02,792 --> 00:18:05,135
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

455
00:18:05,544 --> 00:18:07,928
♪I fall into the abyss♪

456
00:18:15,544 --> 00:18:18,872
♪Shadows torn apart by moonlight♪

457
00:18:20,936 --> 00:18:24,376
♪Shards can't piece together tomorrow♪

458
00:18:24,808 --> 00:18:27,624
♪You set gentle traps♪

459
00:18:27,624 --> 00:18:30,344
♪Trapping me in place♪

460
00:19:15,561 --> 00:19:16,923
(Crashing at your place tonight.)

461
00:19:16,923 --> 00:19:17,970
(Be there in ten minutes.)

462
00:19:24,962 --> 00:19:25,601
The guest room

463
00:19:25,682 --> 00:19:26,561
was already empty.

464
00:19:27,041 --> 00:19:27,521
I don't know

465
00:19:27,521 --> 00:19:28,361
when Meng left.

466
00:19:29,242 --> 00:19:30,002
Could she...?

467
00:19:30,882 --> 00:19:31,442
She told me

468
00:19:32,321 --> 00:19:33,162
she's out shopping.

469
00:19:38,121 --> 00:19:39,242
If you're this scared,

470
00:19:39,482 --> 00:19:40,402
you should have left.

471
00:19:43,041 --> 00:19:43,482
I'm done.

472
00:19:43,801 --> 00:19:44,482
I'm off to work.

473
00:19:50,601 --> 00:19:51,561
Why is it you again?

474
00:19:51,682 --> 00:19:52,841
Don't you have other cases?

475
00:19:53,002 --> 00:19:54,682
Is your firm doing that bad?

476
00:19:54,922 --> 00:19:56,321
Yu Meng paid me four times my rate,

477
00:19:56,521 --> 00:19:58,198
so I'm putting in four times the effort.

478
00:19:59,642 --> 00:20:00,722
Let's start

479
00:20:00,841 --> 00:20:02,281
with Jiali's structure.

480
00:20:04,761 --> 00:20:05,882
The current chairman?

481
00:20:06,162 --> 00:20:06,882
You all know.

482
00:20:07,242 --> 00:20:08,882
(Di Liren)
Under his strategic guidance,

483
00:20:09,402 --> 00:20:11,121
Jiali was restructured

484
00:20:11,242 --> 00:20:12,442
into three divisions.

485
00:20:13,801 --> 00:20:14,321
I know.

486
00:20:14,841 --> 00:20:15,642
Zhang Yu is

487
00:20:15,801 --> 00:20:16,882
at the Product Center.

488
00:20:17,561 --> 00:20:17,962
Correct.

489
00:20:18,761 --> 00:20:19,922
(The Product Center)

490
00:20:20,242 --> 00:20:22,442
(owns Jiali's entire product pipeline,
like design,)

491
00:20:22,882 --> 00:20:24,281
(R&D, production, and QC.)

492
00:20:24,761 --> 00:20:25,801
(So the Product Center)

493
00:20:25,962 --> 00:20:27,442
(is where it all starts.)

494
00:20:31,521 --> 00:20:32,601
The Brand Center is led

495
00:20:32,962 --> 00:20:33,642
by Gao Shan.

496
00:20:34,521 --> 00:20:35,962
You and Gao Shan were colleagues.

497
00:20:36,281 --> 00:20:37,922
(While Brand Center and Product Center)

498
00:20:38,041 --> 00:20:39,162
(sound very similar,)

499
00:20:39,442 --> 00:20:40,202
(what they do)

500
00:20:40,242 --> 00:20:41,242
(couldn't be)

501
00:20:41,482 --> 00:20:42,242
(more different.)

502
00:20:42,442 --> 00:20:43,761
Gao Shan mainly handles PR,

503
00:20:44,162 --> 00:20:46,442
(Brand Director: Gao Shan)
marketing, and advertising.

504
00:20:46,682 --> 00:20:47,922
And the last division.

505
00:20:51,801 --> 00:20:52,801
E-Commerce Center,

506
00:20:53,041 --> 00:20:54,002
headed

507
00:20:54,361 --> 00:20:54,882
by Luo Ye.

508
00:20:55,841 --> 00:20:57,442
(Riding the live commerce boom,)

509
00:20:57,722 --> 00:20:59,642
(Jiali broke through)

510
00:20:59,642 --> 00:21:00,634
(in the domestic cosmetics market.)

511
00:21:00,922 --> 00:21:02,202
(Though the E-Commerce Center)

512
00:21:02,281 --> 00:21:03,121
(was created last,)

513
00:21:03,321 --> 00:21:04,642
(it is just as vital)

514
00:21:04,801 --> 00:21:05,604
(as the other two.)

515
00:21:06,162 --> 00:21:07,482
Sorry to interrupt you,

516
00:21:07,601 --> 00:21:09,121
but what does any of this have to do

517
00:21:09,121 --> 00:21:10,002
with Meng's audit?

518
00:21:10,361 --> 00:21:12,722
If I handed you the books right now,

519
00:21:13,242 --> 00:21:14,041
could you read it?

520
00:21:14,402 --> 00:21:15,002
No.

521
00:21:15,281 --> 00:21:16,722
Could you tell which stage

522
00:21:16,801 --> 00:21:18,002
Di Liren tampered with?

523
00:21:18,321 --> 00:21:19,041
Production,

524
00:21:19,601 --> 00:21:20,242
sales,

525
00:21:20,601 --> 00:21:21,202
or marketing?

526
00:21:22,682 --> 00:21:23,642
Don't worry.

527
00:21:24,041 --> 00:21:25,402
Since I've made up my mind,

528
00:21:25,722 --> 00:21:27,601
I'll learn whatever it takes.

529
00:21:27,841 --> 00:21:29,321
You can ask Di Liren

530
00:21:29,361 --> 00:21:30,202
to rotate you

531
00:21:30,321 --> 00:21:31,402
through every division.

532
00:21:31,962 --> 00:21:32,922
Rotating keeps her

533
00:21:32,962 --> 00:21:33,761
from core work.

534
00:21:34,962 --> 00:21:36,202
It won't help her.

535
00:21:36,882 --> 00:21:37,361
Right.

536
00:21:37,962 --> 00:21:38,841
I just remembered.

537
00:21:39,162 --> 00:21:40,722
When my dad was in the hospital,

538
00:21:41,081 --> 00:21:42,123
Mr. Dong came to see him

539
00:21:42,601 --> 00:21:43,601
and mentioned mismatches

540
00:21:43,722 --> 00:21:44,682
in the company accounts.

541
00:21:45,081 --> 00:21:46,202
He wanted to discuss it.

542
00:21:47,202 --> 00:21:47,841
When I asked him

543
00:21:47,922 --> 00:21:49,202
for specifics,

544
00:21:49,922 --> 00:21:50,962
he gave a fuzzy answer

545
00:21:51,121 --> 00:21:52,041
and sounded unsure.

546
00:21:53,642 --> 00:21:54,162
Wen Xiaoxiao,

547
00:21:54,561 --> 00:21:55,682
you work under Mr. Dong.

548
00:21:56,361 --> 00:21:57,482
Do you know what happened?

549
00:21:58,242 --> 00:21:59,041
Purchasing?

550
00:21:59,402 --> 00:21:59,922
Purchasing?

551
00:22:00,761 --> 00:22:01,402
A buyer working

552
00:22:01,402 --> 00:22:02,841
at Jiali for over a decade

553
00:22:03,482 --> 00:22:04,561
left last year,

554
00:22:04,922 --> 00:22:06,202
and Di Liren hired a new buyer.

555
00:22:06,841 --> 00:22:08,242
Mr. Dong mentioned tactfully

556
00:22:08,521 --> 00:22:09,442
that procurement costs

557
00:22:09,601 --> 00:22:10,642
became higher than before.

558
00:22:11,041 --> 00:22:12,002
But Di Liren claimed

559
00:22:12,281 --> 00:22:13,922
it was due to normal product upgrades.

560
00:22:15,121 --> 00:22:16,402
Get the supplier list

561
00:22:16,642 --> 00:22:17,563
and check one by one.

562
00:22:18,482 --> 00:22:19,242
The supplier list

563
00:22:19,242 --> 00:22:20,482
is confidential.

564
00:22:21,202 --> 00:22:22,642
It's not accessible for all staff.

565
00:22:23,002 --> 00:22:23,561
I can't get it

566
00:22:23,561 --> 00:22:24,722
as the boss's wife,

567
00:22:24,922 --> 00:22:25,722
or Di Liren

568
00:22:25,841 --> 00:22:26,962
will find out immediately.

569
00:22:28,361 --> 00:22:29,841
Which division oversees procurement?

570
00:22:31,642 --> 00:22:32,442
The Product Center.

571
00:22:34,922 --> 00:22:35,801
That's your target.

572
00:22:36,394 --> 00:22:37,321
Once you start to work,

573
00:22:37,321 --> 00:22:38,442
your first priority

574
00:22:38,801 --> 00:22:40,002
is to get

575
00:22:40,841 --> 00:22:41,722
into that place.

576
00:22:50,008 --> 00:22:53,976
♪I don't need the world
to define how special I am♪

577
00:22:53,976 --> 00:22:55,032
(Long live Dad)

578
00:22:55,922 --> 00:22:57,482
(Everyone has their own agenda)

579
00:22:57,521 --> 00:22:58,081
(and goals.)

580
00:22:58,561 --> 00:22:59,041
(I get it.)

581
00:22:59,521 --> 00:23:00,482
But life

582
00:23:01,002 --> 00:23:02,162
(Go Princess!)
won't wait until I'm fully prepared

583
00:23:02,202 --> 00:23:02,841
to move forward.

584
00:23:03,281 --> 00:23:04,321
(I have to learn as I go,)

585
00:23:04,601 --> 00:23:05,402
(step-by-step.)

586
00:23:06,162 --> 00:23:07,068
(I'm not discouraged,)

587
00:23:07,321 --> 00:23:08,081
(because I know)

588
00:23:08,722 --> 00:23:09,801
(in this world,)

589
00:23:10,202 --> 00:23:11,202
(haste)

590
00:23:11,642 --> 00:23:13,041
(could make efficiency.)

591
00:23:15,162 --> 00:23:16,121
Excuse me,

592
00:23:16,121 --> 00:23:17,242
take care of these calls.

593
00:23:17,801 --> 00:23:18,121
Sure.

594
00:23:18,321 --> 00:23:18,922
Morning.

595
00:23:19,081 --> 00:23:20,361
- Good morning, Mrs. Di.
- Good morning, Mrs. Di.

596
00:23:20,561 --> 00:23:20,962
Morning.

597
00:23:21,368 --> 00:23:25,368
♪So lovely, lovely, lovely♪

598
00:23:26,202 --> 00:23:26,841
(Yu Meng)
Hello.

599
00:23:28,072 --> 00:23:30,840
♪I never fail♪

600
00:23:31,601 --> 00:23:32,162
How is it?

601
00:23:32,922 --> 00:23:34,002
I designed this myself.

602
00:23:34,601 --> 00:23:35,561
They did this

603
00:23:35,561 --> 00:23:36,202
all night.

604
00:23:43,402 --> 00:23:43,882
Honey,

605
00:23:44,361 --> 00:23:45,642
(Brand Ambassador: Yu Meng)
what exactly does

606
00:23:46,002 --> 00:23:47,121
a Brand Ambassador do?

607
00:23:47,882 --> 00:23:50,081
Be beautiful, elegant, and confident.

608
00:23:51,002 --> 00:23:51,442
Honey,

609
00:23:51,962 --> 00:23:53,722
you're the best face for Jiali.

610
00:23:58,488 --> 00:24:00,824
♪Even the wind is enchanted by me♪

611
00:24:00,824 --> 00:24:03,608
♪Even a wrong step
turns into an iconic scene♪

612
00:24:03,608 --> 00:24:07,442
♪Even my meltdowns have my tone♪

613
00:24:07,442 --> 00:24:07,962
Ms. Zhang.

614
00:24:09,922 --> 00:24:10,482
Meng.

615
00:24:11,402 --> 00:24:11,922
Ms. Zhang,

616
00:24:12,321 --> 00:24:14,041
it's my first day back at work.

617
00:24:14,561 --> 00:24:15,882
I hope to learn a lot from you.

618
00:24:16,722 --> 00:24:17,162
Go for it.

619
00:24:17,722 --> 00:24:18,332
By the way,

620
00:24:19,121 --> 00:24:20,321
I brought you a little gift.

621
00:24:20,722 --> 00:24:21,485
Scented candles.

622
00:24:21,642 --> 00:24:22,321
It can help

623
00:24:22,321 --> 00:24:23,242
ease your stress a bit.

624
00:24:23,521 --> 00:24:24,361
Hope you like it.

625
00:24:28,521 --> 00:24:29,162
Thank you.

626
00:24:30,561 --> 00:24:31,162
Ms. Zhang,

627
00:24:31,922 --> 00:24:33,121
although my current title

628
00:24:33,281 --> 00:24:34,642
is Brand Ambassador,

629
00:24:36,041 --> 00:24:37,242
I'm still very interested

630
00:24:37,281 --> 00:24:38,722
in the Product Center.

631
00:24:39,162 --> 00:24:40,361
I'd love to talk with you.

632
00:24:41,281 --> 00:24:42,801
I have a meeting right now,

633
00:24:42,841 --> 00:24:45,041
so I'm afraid I don't have time.

634
00:24:45,081 --> 00:24:45,722
No problem.

635
00:24:45,922 --> 00:24:47,242
Just the time for a quick coffee.

636
00:24:47,962 --> 00:24:49,041
I bought coffee and snacks

637
00:24:49,321 --> 00:24:50,081
for everyone.

638
00:24:50,561 --> 00:24:51,962
You've all been working hard

639
00:24:52,121 --> 00:24:52,761
on the launch.

640
00:24:53,242 --> 00:24:54,882
Lunch break is extended by half an hour,

641
00:24:55,162 --> 00:24:56,081
without overtime.

642
00:24:56,882 --> 00:24:58,761
- Thank you, Mr. Di!
- Thank you, Mr. Di!

643
00:25:01,922 --> 00:25:02,482
Honey,

644
00:25:03,281 --> 00:25:03,841
for you.

645
00:25:04,841 --> 00:25:05,482
Thanks, honey.

646
00:25:06,722 --> 00:25:07,442
On your first day,

647
00:25:07,682 --> 00:25:08,321
don't

648
00:25:08,361 --> 00:25:08,962
be tense.

649
00:25:09,361 --> 00:25:09,985
Take it easy.

650
00:25:11,601 --> 00:25:11,922
Come on.

651
00:25:16,121 --> 00:25:16,841
What is this?

652
00:25:17,361 --> 00:25:18,364
I hired a photographer.

653
00:25:18,882 --> 00:25:19,442
This is

654
00:25:19,482 --> 00:25:20,402
your huge milestone.

655
00:25:20,761 --> 00:25:22,002
We have to capture it.

656
00:25:34,121 --> 00:25:34,601
Excuse me,

657
00:25:34,962 --> 00:25:35,699
can I take a look?

658
00:25:41,482 --> 00:25:42,722
You take great photos.

659
00:25:42,761 --> 00:25:43,361
This camera

660
00:25:43,361 --> 00:25:44,642
is perfect for portraits.

661
00:25:47,321 --> 00:25:48,041
Listen,

662
00:25:48,242 --> 00:25:49,002
we usually

663
00:25:49,002 --> 00:25:49,882
don't have much time

664
00:25:49,962 --> 00:25:50,962
to take nice photos.

665
00:25:51,081 --> 00:25:52,402
Why don't we have him

666
00:25:52,521 --> 00:25:53,521
take shots of everyone

667
00:25:53,521 --> 00:25:54,002
today?

668
00:25:54,162 --> 00:25:55,561
- Sounds great!
- Sounds great!

669
00:25:55,761 --> 00:25:56,482
Listen,

670
00:25:56,761 --> 00:25:58,242
if you see any shots you like,

671
00:25:58,321 --> 00:25:59,402
just ask our photographer

672
00:25:59,601 --> 00:26:00,281
to touch them up.

673
00:26:00,442 --> 00:26:02,121
Consider it a company perk.

674
00:26:02,242 --> 00:26:04,121
- Great.
- Thanks, Meng.

675
00:26:04,882 --> 00:26:05,722
You're welcome.

676
00:26:16,561 --> 00:26:17,642
Not the triumphant return

677
00:26:17,682 --> 00:26:19,202
you imagined, huh?

678
00:26:20,801 --> 00:26:21,761
I didn't expect everyone

679
00:26:22,041 --> 00:26:23,561
to be so skeptical of my comeback.

680
00:26:24,202 --> 00:26:25,482
Di Liren set up your office

681
00:26:25,601 --> 00:26:26,442
like that

682
00:26:26,841 --> 00:26:27,962
just to make everyone

683
00:26:28,002 --> 00:26:28,922
resent you.

684
00:26:29,321 --> 00:26:30,722
He hired a photographer

685
00:26:31,321 --> 00:26:32,361
just to make you look like

686
00:26:32,642 --> 00:26:33,521
you're not

687
00:26:33,722 --> 00:26:34,882
taking work seriously,

688
00:26:35,601 --> 00:26:37,442
making things harder for you.

689
00:26:38,081 --> 00:26:38,801
I know.

690
00:26:39,121 --> 00:26:40,242
That's why I need to connect

691
00:26:40,882 --> 00:26:42,002
with Zhang Yu quickly.

692
00:26:42,002 --> 00:26:42,922
Zhang Yu

693
00:26:43,081 --> 00:26:44,402
already put your scented candle

694
00:26:44,561 --> 00:26:45,321
on her desk.

695
00:26:45,722 --> 00:26:46,642
She must like it.

696
00:26:48,801 --> 00:26:50,041
You're kind of helpful,

697
00:26:50,202 --> 00:26:51,281
catering to her tastes.

698
00:26:51,642 --> 00:26:53,682
Still, I must be quick.

699
00:26:54,121 --> 00:26:55,162
Once Di Liren

700
00:26:55,281 --> 00:26:56,321
gets suspicious,

701
00:26:57,041 --> 00:26:57,801
it'll become harder

702
00:26:57,801 --> 00:26:59,002
to get the procurement data.

703
00:27:00,482 --> 00:27:01,601
Be prepared.

704
00:27:02,121 --> 00:27:03,081
They won't accept you

705
00:27:03,081 --> 00:27:03,601
quite easily.

706
00:27:04,202 --> 00:27:05,361
Your sudden disappearance

707
00:27:05,722 --> 00:27:07,242
canceled the product launch,

708
00:27:08,002 --> 00:27:08,682
and all the work

709
00:27:08,841 --> 00:27:09,841
went down the drain.

710
00:27:11,482 --> 00:27:13,482
Have you ever read old romance novels?

711
00:27:14,202 --> 00:27:15,162
We're the assistants

712
00:27:15,162 --> 00:27:16,202
around the CEO.

713
00:27:16,682 --> 00:27:18,361
When he wants to please his lady,

714
00:27:18,601 --> 00:27:20,041
we're at his beck and call.

715
00:27:20,601 --> 00:27:21,281
That's how

716
00:27:21,321 --> 00:27:22,482
we feel about you right now.

717
00:27:22,682 --> 00:27:24,081
I'm sorry

718
00:27:24,442 --> 00:27:25,882
for disappearing like that.

719
00:27:26,482 --> 00:27:27,202
From now on,

720
00:27:27,801 --> 00:27:28,801
I'll make up for it.

721
00:27:31,442 --> 00:27:32,682
Check this out.

722
00:27:32,761 --> 00:27:33,922
They felt your goodwill.

723
00:27:36,081 --> 00:27:37,002
(Company perk from the boss's wife!)
Someone posted

724
00:27:37,121 --> 00:27:37,801
retouched photos

725
00:27:37,801 --> 00:27:39,321
on WeChat Moments,

726
00:27:39,642 --> 00:27:40,841
thanking you for the perk.

727
00:27:41,561 --> 00:27:42,601
Most workers

728
00:27:42,761 --> 00:27:44,561
look like a mess on weekdays.

729
00:27:45,202 --> 00:27:46,385
They rarely take nice photos,

730
00:27:46,717 --> 00:27:47,679
so it's worth posting.

731
00:27:48,202 --> 00:27:49,521
You're a total people person.

732
00:27:50,041 --> 00:27:51,202
As long as it works.

733
00:27:51,601 --> 00:27:52,682
Di Liren wants everyone

734
00:27:52,682 --> 00:27:53,521
to reject me,

735
00:27:53,882 --> 00:27:54,642
so I can't let him

736
00:27:54,642 --> 00:27:55,922
get his way.

737
00:27:57,962 --> 00:27:59,361
Nothing is scarier

738
00:27:59,801 --> 00:28:01,121
than a resentful workforce.

739
00:28:01,521 --> 00:28:02,682
Go for it, Miss Boss.

740
00:28:04,242 --> 00:28:04,841
I'm off.

741
00:28:05,442 --> 00:28:05,962
Bye.

742
00:28:06,561 --> 00:28:07,882
It's not time to clock out yet.

743
00:28:07,922 --> 00:28:08,442
Leaving?

744
00:28:10,081 --> 00:28:11,722
Since there's nothing I can do here,

745
00:28:12,682 --> 00:28:13,882
I'll try at home.

746
00:28:14,361 --> 00:28:15,202
Two-way approach.

747
00:28:15,682 --> 00:28:16,321
Bye.

748
00:28:22,521 --> 00:28:23,202
Medicine time.

749
00:28:23,682 --> 00:28:24,242
Give it to me.

750
00:28:28,162 --> 00:28:29,761
Open wide, honey.

751
00:28:31,962 --> 00:28:32,561
Water.

752
00:28:38,162 --> 00:28:39,002
Candy, honey.

753
00:28:41,002 --> 00:28:42,162
Here's your candy.

754
00:28:48,281 --> 00:28:49,601
Thanks, Yong.

755
00:29:02,521 --> 00:29:03,242
Say that again?

756
00:29:05,521 --> 00:29:06,321
Yong.

757
00:29:06,922 --> 00:29:07,601
Didn't they

758
00:29:07,601 --> 00:29:08,402
call you that?

759
00:29:09,041 --> 00:29:10,121
Ms. Hui, guess what?

760
00:29:10,402 --> 00:29:11,402
He had a former name,

761
00:29:11,402 --> 00:29:12,361
Fang Yong.

762
00:29:12,722 --> 00:29:13,601
Still, I think

763
00:29:14,002 --> 00:29:14,761
Di Liren

764
00:29:14,761 --> 00:29:15,601
sounds much nicer.

765
00:29:15,841 --> 00:29:16,642
What do you think?

766
00:29:18,722 --> 00:29:20,801
Di Liren...

767
00:29:21,281 --> 00:29:22,682
It sounds like,

768
00:29:23,162 --> 00:29:23,722
well,

769
00:29:24,002 --> 00:29:25,682
the hero in a novel.

770
00:29:27,242 --> 00:29:27,761
Sounds great.

771
00:29:37,962 --> 00:29:38,442
Spill it.

772
00:29:39,361 --> 00:29:40,321
What are you up to now?

773
00:29:41,561 --> 00:29:43,361
I'm not up to anything.

774
00:29:45,281 --> 00:29:46,442
I just find adjusting to work

775
00:29:46,482 --> 00:29:47,561
so hard.

776
00:29:48,202 --> 00:29:49,321
I remember

777
00:29:49,682 --> 00:29:50,682
when you were in sales,

778
00:29:50,761 --> 00:29:52,242
you were top sales in a store, right?

779
00:29:53,521 --> 00:29:54,561
What's wrong, honey?

780
00:29:56,202 --> 00:29:57,682
When you were Fang Yong,

781
00:29:57,841 --> 00:29:59,202
did you have any dark past?

782
00:29:59,321 --> 00:30:00,041
You look so tense.

783
00:30:04,361 --> 00:30:05,841
Teach me, please.

784
00:30:06,002 --> 00:30:06,722
How do I quickly

785
00:30:06,801 --> 00:30:07,841
fit into the workplace?

786
00:30:08,682 --> 00:30:10,162
I built myself up gradually.

787
00:30:10,682 --> 00:30:11,841
I'm still grateful

788
00:30:11,841 --> 00:30:13,761
for my time in sales.

789
00:30:14,482 --> 00:30:15,841
Without that experience,

790
00:30:16,402 --> 00:30:17,002
I wouldn't

791
00:30:17,041 --> 00:30:18,361
be able to run Jiali today.

792
00:30:19,081 --> 00:30:20,202
It's not a dark past.

793
00:30:20,601 --> 00:30:21,642
It's how I got here.

794
00:30:25,041 --> 00:30:26,922
You're so amazing.

795
00:30:27,882 --> 00:30:29,321
Did your female clients back then

796
00:30:30,081 --> 00:30:31,121
ever hit on you?

797
00:30:32,962 --> 00:30:34,002
I was professional.

798
00:30:34,081 --> 00:30:34,841
What about friends?

799
00:30:35,561 --> 00:30:36,521
Or colleagues?

800
00:30:36,922 --> 00:30:38,041
Don't people say

801
00:30:38,601 --> 00:30:39,642
a stable earner

802
00:30:39,841 --> 00:30:41,402
should pair with a high earner?

803
00:30:42,162 --> 00:30:42,801
No one

804
00:30:42,801 --> 00:30:44,081
tried to set you up

805
00:30:44,841 --> 00:30:48,041
with pretty teachers

806
00:30:48,242 --> 00:30:49,202
or nurses?

807
00:30:53,521 --> 00:30:54,361
I didn't want it,

808
00:30:54,962 --> 00:30:56,442
so I wore a ring.

809
00:30:57,202 --> 00:30:58,601
Most people assumed I was married.

810
00:31:00,722 --> 00:31:01,962
Liar.

811
00:31:03,081 --> 00:31:04,121
When we first met,

812
00:31:04,121 --> 00:31:05,402
you weren't wearing a ring.

813
00:31:06,121 --> 00:31:06,642
It's true.

814
00:31:08,081 --> 00:31:09,482
I fell for you at first sight,

815
00:31:09,929 --> 00:31:11,442
so I didn't want you to get me wrong.

816
00:31:11,442 --> 00:31:12,402
I don't believe you.

817
00:31:12,561 --> 00:31:13,521
I was in such a mess

818
00:31:13,682 --> 00:31:14,442
back then.

819
00:31:15,281 --> 00:31:15,962
Tell me then,

820
00:31:16,642 --> 00:31:17,722
what did you like about me?

821
00:31:18,081 --> 00:31:18,949
When I first saw you,

822
00:31:19,321 --> 00:31:20,442
I wanted to protect you.

823
00:31:21,202 --> 00:31:22,242
Why else would I chase

824
00:31:22,281 --> 00:31:23,002
after the driver?

825
00:31:23,482 --> 00:31:24,081
Logically,

826
00:31:24,642 --> 00:31:25,801
we didn't know each other.

827
00:31:26,202 --> 00:31:27,121
Calling an ambulance

828
00:31:27,121 --> 00:31:27,761
was enough.

829
00:31:41,682 --> 00:31:42,801
Where did this go?

830
00:31:43,601 --> 00:31:44,242
Didn't you

831
00:31:44,402 --> 00:31:45,202
ask for advice?

832
00:31:46,442 --> 00:31:47,601
I just can't get it, honey.

833
00:31:48,202 --> 00:31:49,482
It's too hard.

834
00:31:50,002 --> 00:31:50,962
Then don't bother.

835
00:31:51,361 --> 00:31:52,187
Leave it all to me.

836
00:32:10,041 --> 00:32:10,521
Where's she?

837
00:32:11,162 --> 00:32:11,642
Sleeping.

838
00:32:15,521 --> 00:32:16,162
What happened?

839
00:32:16,361 --> 00:32:17,242
It's just a cut.

840
00:32:19,521 --> 00:32:21,442
Why did she suddenly call you Yong?

841
00:32:22,281 --> 00:32:23,242
She knows the name.

842
00:32:24,321 --> 00:32:25,242
I told her before.

843
00:32:25,682 --> 00:32:26,202
You told her

844
00:32:26,202 --> 00:32:27,242
a lot about your past?

845
00:32:27,922 --> 00:32:29,482
My former name is on the registry.

846
00:32:29,922 --> 00:32:31,081
What was I supposed to do?

847
00:32:33,081 --> 00:32:34,642
So in your version of the story,

848
00:32:35,242 --> 00:32:36,561
it was love at first sight.

849
00:32:36,801 --> 00:32:38,482
I was just humoring her.

850
00:32:39,321 --> 00:32:40,482
She's just like a child.

851
00:32:41,002 --> 00:32:42,922
All she thinks about is shopping,

852
00:32:43,041 --> 00:32:43,801
hanging out,

853
00:32:44,121 --> 00:32:45,002
and being loved.

854
00:32:45,202 --> 00:32:46,121
She needs pampering.

855
00:32:46,442 --> 00:32:48,162
Only people in love baby their partners.

856
00:32:49,642 --> 00:32:51,081
You looked happy humoring her.

857
00:32:51,561 --> 00:32:52,642
I have no choice.

858
00:32:56,002 --> 00:32:57,442
But right now, I can't figure out

859
00:32:57,882 --> 00:32:59,242
what she's really up to.

860
00:32:59,601 --> 00:33:00,402
At first, I thought

861
00:33:00,561 --> 00:33:01,601
she wanted to bust me,

862
00:33:02,361 --> 00:33:03,561
suspecting an office affair.

863
00:33:04,041 --> 00:33:05,242
So she went back to work.

864
00:33:05,642 --> 00:33:07,041
Do you have an office affair?

865
00:33:12,081 --> 00:33:13,162
She dropped the case.

866
00:33:13,682 --> 00:33:14,801
I thought she was done,

867
00:33:15,361 --> 00:33:16,682
yet she still moved out.

868
00:33:17,081 --> 00:33:17,882
It's not because of

869
00:33:17,882 --> 00:33:18,442
her injury.

870
00:33:18,922 --> 00:33:19,761
She just doesn't want

871
00:33:19,801 --> 00:33:20,761
to sleep with me.

872
00:33:21,801 --> 00:33:22,722
So now

873
00:33:22,722 --> 00:33:23,722
you're discussing with me

874
00:33:23,722 --> 00:33:24,321
why she won't

875
00:33:24,361 --> 00:33:25,281
sleep with you?

876
00:33:28,922 --> 00:33:30,521
Aren't you here to help me?

877
00:33:31,601 --> 00:33:33,121
Isn't this part of the plan?

878
00:33:34,361 --> 00:33:35,321
What's wrong with you?

879
00:33:35,761 --> 00:33:36,321
Fang Yong.

880
00:33:37,081 --> 00:33:38,121
If I didn't know you,

881
00:33:38,801 --> 00:33:39,561
hearing that,

882
00:33:40,321 --> 00:33:41,642
I'd think you actually love her.

883
00:34:13,121 --> 00:34:14,402
(Her attitude)

884
00:34:14,842 --> 00:34:15,681
(has changed a bit.)

885
00:34:17,762 --> 00:34:19,282
(Strike while the iron is hot.)

886
00:34:42,002 --> 00:34:42,641
Hello.

887
00:34:42,802 --> 00:34:43,962
You need to register here.

888
00:34:52,362 --> 00:34:52,842
Ms. Hui.

889
